^{:go/end 889} (go/func inlineCallCheck "inlineCallCheck returns whether a call will never be inlineable\nfor basic reasons, and whether the call is an intrinisic call.\nThe intrinsic result singles out intrinsic calls for debug logging.\n" [^{:tag (* ir/Func)} callerfn ^{:tag (* ir/CallExpr)} call] :results [bool bool]
